            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The file Sociodemographic_neuropsychological.xlsx contains sociodemographic data from participants and the score values obtained in the neuropsychological tests.<br>The file Accuracy.xlsx contains the values for accuracy rates (%)  in the emotional perspective-taking task.<br>The file Reaction_times.xlsx contains the values for reaction times  in the emotional perspective-taking task.<br>The file N170_Congruent contains values of N170 peak amplitudes (µV) by group for the congruent condition.<br>The file N170_Incongruent contains values of N170 peak amplitudes (µV) by group for the incongruent condition.<br>The file LPPe_Congruent contains values of early LPPs mean amplitudes  (µV) by group for the congruent condition.<br>The file LPPe_Incongruent contains values of early LPPs mean amplitudes  (µV) by group for the incongruent condition.<br>The file LPPl_Congruent contains values of late LPPs mean amplitudes  (µV) by group for the congruent condition.<br>The file LPPl_Congruent contains values of late LPPs mean amplitudes  (µV) by group for the incongruent condition.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
